# The markdown in this directory is a byte-identical copy of the canonical documents at the
# repository root (PLAN.md D12), written by `pnpm sync:docs` and verified by `pnpm sync:docs --check`.
#
# Prettier must not touch it. Formatting the copy would rewrite the markdown tables, turn `*after*`
# into `_after_` and re-wrap the delimiter rows — every one of those edits is drift from the
# canonical file, which is exactly what the check in CI exists to catch.
#
# `web/package.json` passes this file to Prettier with `--ignore-path`, alongside the repository's
# own `.gitignore` and `.prettierignore`.
*.md
!README.md
